        "kind": "Reference",
        "paragraphs": [
          "The garden feeds and supports the monastery. Generations of monks have propagated an old Brineheart lineage for its usefulness, without knowing its origin. Its plants are not a puzzle.\n\nThe wider landscape preserves traces of older cultivation associated with a minor Sea Guardian station, but the monastery is not a major sanctuary."
        ],
        "html": "<p>The garden feeds and supports the monastery. Generations of monks have propagated an old Brineheart lineage for its usefulness, without knowing its origin. Its plants are not a puzzle.</p>\n<p>The wider landscape preserves traces of older cultivation associated with a minor Sea Guardian station, but the monastery is not a major sanctuary.</p>",
