        "title": "What the Kale Means",
        "kind": "Reference",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Sailor's Kale spreads too easily to prove that Greenbank supplied this island population. It does establish Greenbank as a real agricultural contact Agelus knew, used, and wanted to visit: enough for the Company to investigate his later movements."
        ],
        "html": "<p>Sailor&#x27;s Kale spreads too easily to prove that Greenbank supplied this island population. It does establish Greenbank as a real agricultural contact Agelus knew, used, and wanted to visit: enough for the Company to investigate his later movements.</p>",
