    "rawOriginal": "---\nworkbench:\n  schema: 1\n  id: \"d02c7f1d-91bd-4d6d-a29d-08b5cc25e0bd\"\n  title: \"Scene 7 — Preparing for J\"\n  type: scene\n  purpose: session\n  status: draft\n---\n# Scene 7 — Preparing for J\n\n## Purpose\n\nPause before Sanctuary 2 so the Company can process the discovery, choose what to take, ask questions, and decide whether to pursue Agelus immediately.\n\n## Questions They May Ask\n\n### Why didn't Agelus tell anyone about the Sea Guardians?\n\nBecause he did not know about them.\n\nHe believed he had reconstructed an old maritime cultivation/distribution system.\n\n### Why J?\n\nIt is one of his strongest predictions and provides a meaningful physical test of the model.\n\n### Did he expect danger?\n\nOnly the ordinary risks of a remote maritime expedition.\n\nHe expected to return.\n\n### Does Greenbank know the exact route?\n\nEnough to establish his intended region and departure.\n\nThe exact approach belongs to the Sanctuary 2 adventure.\n\n### Are all eight centers Sea Guardian sites?\n\n*DM-only answer; the Company does not know the truth below.*\n\nNobody knows.\n\nThey are not.\n\nX is a false positive, but the Company has no reason to know that yet.\n\n## Related Material\n\n- [Adventure overview](../agelus_trail_playable_scenes.md)\n- [Previous scene](06_reading_agelus_map.md)\n",
